---
import '../styles/cage.css';
import GoogleAnalytics from '../components/GoogleAnalytics.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteIcons from '../components/SiteIcons.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <GoogleAnalytics />
  <title>网站统计与隐私 · ccBox</title>
  {Astro.site && <link rel="canonical" href={new URL(base + 'privacy/', Astro.site)} />}
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#1b1917" />
  <SiteIcons />
</head>
<body>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="wrap privacy-page">
    <header class="page-intro dark-surface">
      <h1>网站统计与隐私</h1>
      <a class="text-link" href="#privacy-en" lang="en">English <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
    </header>
    <div class="privacy-prose">
    <p>官网及使用文档使用 Google Analytics 4，统计活跃用户、页面访问量、访问来源，以及设备和语言等基本访问信息，用于改进网站内容。</p>
    <p>Google Analytics 使用第一方 Cookie 区分浏览器及访问会话。活跃用户数是统计估算，跨设备访问、浏览器限制和统计拦截会影响结果。</p>
    <p>我们配置的页面浏览记录中，页面地址只包含站点和路径，来源只包含来源站点。广告个性化与 Google Signals 已关闭。数据由 Google 处理，详情见 <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites?hl=zh-CN">Google 如何使用合作伙伴网站的信息</a>。</p>
    <p>你可以通过浏览器隐私设置限制 Cookie，或使用 <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout/">Google Analytics 停用插件</a>限制统计。</p>
    <section id="privacy-en" lang="en">
      <h2>Website analytics and privacy</h2>
      <p>This website and its documentation use Google Analytics 4 to measure active users, page views, referral sites, and basic device and language information. Google uses first-party cookies to distinguish browsers and sessions. User counts are estimates affected by multiple devices, browser restrictions, and blockers.</p>
      <p>Our page-view configuration sends the page origin and path, and the referring origin. Google Signals and advertising personalization are disabled. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites?hl=en">how Google uses information from partner sites</a>. You can restrict cookies in your browser or use the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout/">Google Analytics opt-out add-on</a>.</p>
    </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</body>
</html>
<style>
  .privacy-page { padding-block: clamp(28px, 4vw, 52px) var(--section-space); }
  .page-intro a { display: inline-block; margin-block-start: 18px; color: var(--accent); }
  .privacy-prose { max-width: 75ch; margin-block-start: clamp(26px, 4vw, 48px); }
  .privacy-prose p + p { margin-block-start: 14px; }
  .privacy-prose section { margin-block-start: 36px; padding-block-start: 24px; border-block-start: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .privacy-prose h2 { margin-block-end: 14px; font-size: clamp(21px, 3vw, 28px); }
  .privacy-prose a { color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
</style>
